NOT COVERED BY THIS LICENSE
===========================

The MIT license above applies to the source code only.

The bundled sound effects in `stfu/assets/sounds/` are NOT covered by it. They
were collected from the internet and their origin and licensing status are
unknown. They are included because the app is useless without something to
play, not because any right to redistribute them has been established.

If you fork, redistribute, or ship this software, replace those files with
audio you have the right to distribute. Deleting them is safe: the app treats
an empty clip folder as "no sound" and works normally.
